{"version":1,"title":"WORK-LAB Observer 3.0 云端审计与全量重构方案","backing_conversation_id":"6a81c454-5950-83ea-8eae-e82f880787cd","widget_session_id":"a51bbc85-cbb1-49ae-82fd-9b899cc70314","widget_state":{"status":"completed","is_static_preview":true,"report_message":{"id":"d9d15903-11df-4ecf-b496-e3cfbb710160","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1786889433.431443,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["# WORK-LAB Observer 3.0 云端审计与全量重构方案\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n截至 **2026-08-16**，已通过连接的 GitHub 对私有仓库 **`DTALEX66/WORK-LAB`** 的仓库身份、`main` 分支、最新提交与递归树进行了云端核验；当前默认分支为 `main`，最新已确认提交为 **`5fc107bbfe8a09e917b5f991e4c3f013d6a5117e`**，提交时间为 **2026-08-15 18:33:26 UTC**，且 `main` 当前未启用 branch protection。[GitHub API: `DTALEX66/WORK-LAB`, `main@5fc107b`]\n\n从已核验云端结构与 Observer 前端源码证据看，**WORK-LAB 的核心问题不是“Dashboard CSS 不够漂亮”，而是 Observer 的产品信息架构、Projection 模型与视觉架构仍以 Project/KPI Dashboard 为中心，而 WORK-LAB 本身已经需要一个 Execution/Trace 驱动的 AI Workflow Control Plane。** 当前 `fusion-v3.js` 同时存在 Project Overview、Runtime Matrix、Project Health 等语义重叠的展示面，导致视觉密度高但信息层级弱；与此同时，`api.js`、`state.js` 的 GET-only、loopback、last-good、fail-closed 真实性设计反而是当前最成熟、最不应该被 UI 重构破坏的部分。fileciteturn0file2L59-L98 fileciteturn0file7L1-L10 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\nObserver 3.0 的正确升级不是引入 Grafana/React/ClickHouse，也不是继续“堆卡片”，而是保持 **Vanilla JS + Tauri + 本地只读 Projection**，在中间新增清晰的 **Execution-centric Projection + provenance/freshness model + view-model/selectors**，让前端围绕 `Execution → Span → Event → Agent/Model/Tool → Project/Git/CI → Evidence` 展开。\n\nUI 应彻底重做为一个安静、专业、开发者工具级的 **READ-ONLY AI Workflow Control Plane**：Overview 负责态势感知，Executions 负责 Trace/Waterfall，Projects 负责项目事实，Delivery 负责 Git/CI/Artifact，Trust 负责 freshness/coverage/evidence/governance。**不允许 UNKNOWN→0、不允许 stale→live、不允许没有证据的健康状态、不允许构造模型成本/Token/进度。**\n\n需要特别说明审计边界：本轮 GitHub 云端已核验仓库 metadata、`main` SHA、branch metadata 和 recursive tree，但工具返回在完整逐文件展开前被截断，因此 **open PR、main check-runs/CI、所有分支逐一 divergence、后端每个 schema blob 的逐行内容没有被可靠地保留在本次证据集里**。下文不会伪造这些结果；这些项被列为实施 TaskPack 的 Gate Zero。此前上传的前端文件提供了精确行级证据，但在没有 blob SHA 对比前，不把它们冒充为 `main@5fc107b` 的逐字副本。\n\n## 云端仓库审计与当前架构\n\n**交付映射：本节与下一节构成 `WORK-LAB_OBSERVER_3_AUDIT_REPORT.md`。**\n\n### 云端仓库状态\n\n| 审计项 | 已确认状态 | 证据 | 判断 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Repository | `DTALEX66/WORK-LAB` | GitHub Repository API | 已核验 |\n| Visibility | Private | GitHub Repository API | 已核验 |\n| Default branch | `main` | GitHub Repository API | 已核验 |\n| Latest main SHA | `5fc107bbfe8a09e917b5f991e4c3f013d6a5117e` | GitHub Branch API | **重构 baseline** |\n| Parent SHA | `54ecb503b9492d73c67cf069e2488d7e1c019402` | GitHub Branch API | 已核验 |\n| Tree SHA | `8a29dfc95fc69e607e5cdc31333248113ce302bb` | GitHub Branch API | 已核验 |\n| Latest main commit | `chore: trigger netlify rebuild after domain migration` | GitHub Branch API | 2026-08-15 |\n| Commit timestamp | `2026-08-15T18:33:26Z` | GitHub Branch API | 已核验 |\n| `main` protection | `protected: false` | GitHub Branch API | **P1 仓库治理风险** |\n| Branches | 已确认存在多条 `claude/*` 与 `dependabot/*` 工作分支 | GitHub Branches API | 完整计数未保存在最终证据集 |\n| Open issues count | Repository metadata 返回 `0` | GitHub Repository API | **不能等同于“0 open PR”** |\n| Open PR | 未形成可审计结果 | 未完成 Pull API evidence | Gate Zero 必查 |\n| Main CI/check-runs | 未形成可审计结果 | 未完成 Check Runs evidence | Gate Zero 必查 |\n| Recursive repository tree | 已请求 `main@5fc107b` recursive tree | GitHub Tree API | 云端树已取得，但本次未逐项持久化 |\n| Repo language | Python | GitHub Repository API | 与 Observer backend 结构吻合 |\n| Last pushed | `2026-08-15T18:33:26Z` | GitHub Repository API | 已核验 |\n\n这里有一个与 Observer 本身无关、但必须进入工程门禁的问题：**`main` 未保护。** 对 WORK-LAB 这种包含 governance、workflow、Observer 与 taskpacks 的控制仓库，建议至少配置 GitHub Ruleset：禁止 force-push、要求 PR 或受控直接提交、要求核心验证 check 通过。它是 P1，不应该阻塞 Observer 3.0 的本地开发，但应该在合并前解决。[GitHub API: branch `main`, `protected=false`, `5fc107b`]\n\n### 当前 Observer 的正确产品边界\n\n从现有前端契约看，WORK-LAB Observer 已经拥有非常值得保留的“Truth First”基础。\n\n`api.js` 将数据模式明确区分并把前端限制为只读 GET；LIVE 不是一个视觉标签，而是后端/transport 满足条件后才成立。fileciteturn0file7L1-L10\n\n`state.js` 具备 **last-good** 机制：刷新失败不应把最后一次可信观察清空，而应保留其值并降级成 stale/offline。这比很多“漂亮 Dashboard”更重要，因为它决定页面上的数字究竟是观测事实还是 UI 幻觉。fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n`render-v3.js` 的已有原则也明确要求 canonical/local Git facts 优先、只有真实 usage 样本才显示 usage、未采集值不能装成实时 KPI、`null/UNKNOWN` 不得被美化为零或 healthy。fileciteturn0file4L3-L8\n\nLIVE 路径还存在更严格的 transport validation，包括 event stream、coverage、heartbeat/watermark 等约束；这属于 Observer 3.0 的冻结边界。fileciteturn0file7L271-L287\n\n因此 Observer 3.0 不应该采用：\n\n```text\n重写 API\n→ 重写 state\n→ 接一个新的 Dashboard framework\n→ 再去适配真实性\n```\n\n应该采用：\n\n```text\n保留 Truth Boundary\n        │\n        ▼\n增强 Projection / Provenance\n        │\n        ▼\nView Model / Selectors\n        │\n        ▼\n重新构建整个 Information Architecture\n        │\n        ▼\n全新 Command Center UI\n```\n\n### 当前逻辑架构\n\n以下图中，**GET/SSE → api.js → state.js → renderer** 由现有前端代码直接支持；上游 Workflow/Event/Evidence/Projection 是 WORK-LAB 当前 Observer 产品边界的逻辑表达。后端逐文件调用关系仍需在 Gate Zero 用 `main@5fc107b` 再做函数级锁定。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    WA[\"10-workflow<br/>Workflow Assistance\"] --> PE[\"Public Events\"]\n    WA --> EE[\"Sanitized Evidence\"]\n\n    PE --> V[\"Observer validation<br/>sensitive filtering\"]\n    EE --> V\n\n    V --> P[\"Read-only Projection\"]\n    P --> S[\"Snapshot / Revision\"]\n\n    S --> API[\"Loopback API<br/>GET-only\"]\n    S --> SSE[\"Local event transport / SSE\"]\n\n    API --> WEBAPI[\"web / api.js\"]\n    SSE --> WEBAPI\n\n    WEBAPI --> STATE[\"state.js<br/>last-good / stale / offline\"]\n    STATE --> APP[\"app.js\"]\n\n    APP --> FUSION[\"fusion-v3.js\"]\n    APP --> RV3[\"render-v3.js\"]\n    APP --> LEGACY[\"legacy render.js\"]\n\n    FUSION --> UI[\"Observer UI\"]\n    RV3 --> UI\n    LEGACY --> UI\n\n    UI --> TAURI[\"Tauri desktop shell\"]\n\n    classDef frozen stroke-width:3px;\n    class API,WEBAPI,STATE frozen;\n```\n\n`app.js` 已经优先将完整 v3 surface 交给 `WlFusionV3.render(d)`，因此 **Fusion 是最合理的 UI 迁移切入点，而不是 api/state**。fileciteturn0file8L82-L103\n\n### 当前数据流为什么“技术上对、产品上不对”\n\n现有页面的主要矛盾可以概括为：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    F[\"真实事实\"] --> P[\"Project-oriented projection\"]\n    P --> A[\"Project Overview\"]\n    P --> B[\"Runtime Matrix\"]\n    P --> C[\"Project Health\"]\n    P --> D[\"Token Dashboard\"]\n    P --> E[\"Governance\"]\n\n    A --> X[\"同一项目多次出现\"]\n    B --> X\n    C --> X\n\n    X --> Y[\"高信息量 ≠ 高信息价值\"]\n    Y --> Z[\"用户仍然回答不了：<br/>现在是谁在做什么、哪一步、为什么卡住？\"]\n```\n\n`fusion-v3.js` 已有 Project Overview / Runtime Matrix / Project Health 等多个并列 surface，这就是目前布局“满、散、重复、没质感”的核心代码级原因之一。fileciteturn0file2L59-L98\n\n真正的 AI 工作流问题不是：\n\n> “这个项目是绿色还是黄色？”\n\n而是：\n\n> “当前 Execution 是谁发起的？哪个 Agent 在执行？调用了哪个模型/工具？Git 改了什么？CI 在哪一步？证据是否可信？最后一个可信 observation 是什么时候？”\n\n这就是从 **Project-centric Dashboard** 向 **Execution-centric Control Plane** 升级的根本原因。\n\n## Observer 技术审计、优先级与证据\n\n### 核心问题清单\n\n| Priority | 问题 | 证据/来源 | 实际影响 | 建议 | Effort |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **P0** | 多 renderer/surface 对同一事实做重复解释 | `fusion-v3.js`: Project Overview / Runtime Matrix / Project Health fileciteturn0file2L59-L98 | 同一状态容易被不同 UI 解释成不同含义，用户产生“数据不准”感 | 建立单一 selectors/view-model + domain surface | 高 |\n| **P0** | UI 中缺少第一等公民的 Execution/Trace 表达 | 已核验前端 surface 未体现完整 trace-first IA；仓库全局后端是否已有类似对象需 Gate Zero 复核 | 看得到项目，难以看清 AI 工作流“正在发生什么” | Projection V3 引入 Execution/Span/Event | 高 |\n| **P0** | 事实值、衍生值、未知值需要更严格视觉区分 | `render-v3.js` 已明确 null/UNKNOWN 不得装饰成 KPI fileciteturn0file4L3-L8 | aggregate health 容易掩盖 source uncertainty | 每个动态 domain 携带 provenance/freshness/derivation | 高 |\n| **P0** | stale/last-good 如果只做全局状态，会让局部旧数据看似当前 | `state.js` last-good 机制本身正确 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97 | “页面有值”被误读成“值是新的” | V3 增加 source/domain freshness，保持全局 last-good | 中 |\n| **P0** | LIVE 真实性不能因重构下降 | `api.js` LIVE/transport validation fileciteturn0file7L271-L287 | 一旦 UI 自行猜 LIVE，Observer 的核心可信度失效 | `api.js/state.js` 行为冻结 | 低 |\n| **P1** | 信息架构是“模块并排”，不是“任务决策路径” | `fusion-v3.js` 当前 composition fileciteturn0file2L59-L98 | 首屏不能在 3 秒内回答“哪里需要注意” | Overview → Execution → Project → Delivery → Trust | 高 |\n| **P1** | `render.js` / `render-v3.js` / `fusion-v3.js` 迁移层次过多 | `app.js` v3 routing fileciteturn0file8L82-L103 | 维护成本、状态映射漂移、视觉不一致 | Legacy 冻结；V3 组件化；完成后删除旧 surface | 中 |\n| **P1** | Project Health 将多个独立 domain 压成一个“健康”概念 | fusion project surfaces | CI failure、dirty tree、runtime idle、data stale 语义完全不同 | 使用 explicit attention/reason codes | 中 |\n| **P1** | 缺少“数据可信度”作为一级导航 | 真实性逻辑存在于 api/state，但不等于用户可见 | 用户看到值却不知道 source age/coverage | Trust Center 升为一级 surface | 中 |\n| **P1** | `main` 未启用 protection | GitHub API `protected=false` | Observer 3.0 可被未经 gate 的提交覆盖 | Ruleset / required checks | 低 |\n| **P1** | 前端组件不是明确 domain component tree | 当前 renderer-heavy structure | UI 改版越来越依赖大 renderer | View model + components + views 分层 | 高 |\n| **P1** | 图表不应承担“制造产品感”的责任 | 当前 native SVG chart 本身并非根因 | 容易误把多图表当观测能力 | 保持 native SVG，先修 IA | 低 |\n| **P2** | 视觉层缺少统一 elevation、radius、typography、status semantics | 当前 CSS 云端 blob 未完成逐行核验；属于视觉重构目标而非已证实 bug | 页面像多个 Dashboard 拼起来 | 建立 tokens.css + semantic components | 中 |\n| **P2** | 状态组件应消除“只靠颜色” | accessibility 已存在 keyboard/live-region 基础 fileciteturn0file6L20-L41 | 无障碍与状态辨识度不足 | icon + text + color 三重表达 | 低 |\n| **P2** | Compact View 应是专用工作模式而非缩小 Full | 产品架构问题 | 常驻窗口价值低 | 独立 compact IA | 中 |\n\n### “数据不准”应怎样定义\n\n我不建议把“数据不准”简单归因于 backend collector。现有证据更像是三种问题混合在一起：\n\n**事实错误**：源数据本身错。这需要 collector/schema/test 证明。\n\n**时间错误**：值曾经正确，但 freshness 已过期。last-good 的存在意味着这种状态本来就是预期状态，而 UI 必须明确显示“last verified at”。fileciteturn0file5L68-L97\n\n**语义错误**：原始值正确，但 UI 把多个事实压成一个 “Healthy/Running/Active”。这是当前最值得优先解决的问题。\n\nObserver 3.0 应统一使用以下四种语义：\n\n| 类型 | 示例 | UI 表达 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `observed` | Git HEAD=`a71bc82` | 直接展示 + source + observedAt |\n| `derived` | Attention=`BLOCKED` | 展示推导原因，例如 `CI_FAILED` |\n| `unknown` | Token collector 无数据 | `UNKNOWN` / `Not observed`，绝不显示 `0` |\n| `stale` | 最后 Git observation 12 分钟前 | 保留值，但明确 `Last verified 12m ago` |\n\n这比继续调整 Project Health 算法重要得多。\n\n### 当前前端组件树判断\n\n基于已取得前端源码，当前逻辑形态接近：\n\n```text\napp.js\n├── api.js\n├── state.js\n├── formatters.js\n├── accessibility.js\n├── charts.js\n├── render.js                 # legacy\n├── render-v3.js              # truth-aware render primitives/surfaces\n└── fusion-v3.js              # production v3 composition\n    ├── signal strip\n    ├── project overview\n    ├── runtime matrix\n    ├── token dashboard\n    ├── project health\n    └── governance\n```\n\n`app.js` 当前已有对 V3 full-view 的明确入口，说明无需为了组件化而引入 React/Vue。fileciteturn0file8L82-L103\n\n目标树应改成：\n\n```text\nweb/scripts/\n├── core/\n│   ├── api.js\n│   ├── state.js\n│   └── contracts.js\n├── model/\n│   ├── selectors.js\n│   ├── status-meta.js\n│   ├── freshness.js\n│   └── view-model.js\n├── components/\n│   ├── status-chip.js\n│   ├── metric.js\n│   ├── project-row.js\n│   ├── execution-row.js\n│   ├── trace-waterfall.js\n│   ├── event-stream.js\n│   ├── source-age.js\n│   ├── empty-state.js\n│   └── data-table.js\n├── views/\n│   ├── overview.js\n│   ├── executions.js\n│   ├── projects.js\n│   ├── delivery.js\n│   └── trust.js\n├── charts.js\n├── accessibility.js\n└── app.js\n```\n\n这是**逻辑拆分建议**，不要求第一阶段机械创建二十个小文件。Vanilla JS 过度组件化同样是反模式；只有存在复用/独立测试价值的 domain component 才拆文件。\n\n### CSS token 现状与目标\n\n本轮没有拿到 `main@5fc107b` 的完整 CSS blob，因此不能诚实地给出“当前所有 hex/token 的逐行 inventory”。这项必须由 TaskPack Gate Zero 自动提取。设计目标如下：\n\n| Domain | V3 Semantic Token | 用途 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Canvas | `--wl-bg-canvas` | 最底层应用背景 |\n| Surface | `--wl-surface-1` | 主面板 |\n| Elevated | `--wl-surface-2` | dropdown/details |\n| Border | `--wl-border-subtle` | 默认边界 |\n| Text | `--wl-text-primary` | 一级信息 |\n| Secondary | `--wl-text-secondary` | metadata |\n| Muted | `--wl-text-muted` | 低优先信息 |\n| Brand | `--wl-accent` | 选中/交互，不等于状态 |\n| Success | `--wl-status-success` | 明确成功 |\n| Running | `--wl-status-running` | 正在进行 |\n| Warning | `--wl-status-warning` | 需要注意 |\n| Critical | `--wl-status-critical` | 明确失败 |\n| Unknown | `--wl-status-unknown` | 未观测 |\n| Stale | `--wl-status-stale` | 旧的可信值 |\n| Radius | `--wl-radius-sm/md/lg` | 统一几何 |\n| Space | `--wl-space-*` | 4/8px spacing system |\n| Motion | `--wl-motion-fast/normal` | 120–180ms |\n\nGate Zero 应执行：\n\n```text\n扫描 web/styles/**/*.css\n\n输出：\nCSS_CUSTOM_PROPERTIES.md\nHARDCODED_COLORS.md\nDUPLICATE_STATUS_COLORS.md\nUNUSED_SELECTORS.md\n```\n\n而不是“看到页面不好看就重写 CSS”。\n\n### 安全与隐私判断\n\n安全方向应该继续坚持：\n\n```text\nObserver = projection consumer\nObserver ≠ executor\nObserver ≠ ledger writer\nObserver ≠ prompt viewer\nObserver ≠ credential viewer\n```\n\n前端 API 层已经明确强调前端不写服务器以及本地 LIVE 约束。fileciteturn0file7L1-L10\n\nObserver 3.0 新增 Trace 时最大的隐私风险反而会上升，因为 Trace 天然容易诱使开发者加入：\n\n```text\nprompt\nresponse\ntool arguments\nshell command output\nauthorization\nAPI key\nenvironment variables\nfilesystem secret\n```\n\n因此 **Span.attributes 必须 allowlist，而不是 blacklist**。\n\n推荐原则：\n\n```text\n允许：\nagent_id\nmodel_id\ntool_kind\nproject_id\nrepository\nbranch\ncommit_sha\nci_state\nduration_ms\ntoken_count（若源显式公开）\ncost（若源显式公开）\nstatus/reason codes\nevidence references\n\n禁止：\nprompt body\nresponse body\nraw tool input/output\nheaders\ncredential\nenvironment secrets\nprivate memory\nprovider state\n```\n\n### 尚未核验、绝不能伪造的仓库事实\n\n| 项目 | 本报告状态 |\n|---|---|\n| 全部分支精确数量与名称 | **未完整保留** |\n| 每条分支相对 main ahead/behind | **未核验** |\n| 当前 open PR 数量/详情 | **未核验** |\n| `main@5fc107b` check-runs | **未核验** |\n| GitHub Actions 当前成功/失败状态 | **未核验** |\n| Observer backend 每个 Python 文件逐行调用图 | **未完成** |\n| Projection JSON Schema 完整逐行 diff | **需 Gate Zero 基于 actual blob 生成** |\n| CSS 当前 token/hex 全量统计 | **需 Gate Zero 生成** |\n| Playwright 是否已经安装 | **未核验** |\n| 上传 JS 与 main blob 是否完全一致 | **未做 blob SHA 对比** |\n\n因此我不把这些位置填成“0 PR”“CI green”“没有 Execution schema”等听起来漂亮但未经证实的数据。\n\n## Observer 3.0 数据模型与目标架构\n\n**本节可直接保存为 `PROJECTION_SCHEMA_DIFF.md`。**\n\n### 架构原则\n\nObserver 3.0 不应直接采用 SigNoz/Langfuse 的技术栈；应该学习它们最重要的**观测对象模型**。\n\n核心转换：\n\n```text\nV2 思维\n\nProject\n├── Status\n├── Git\n├── CI\n└── Usage\n\n\n                ↓\n\n\nV3 思维\n\nExecution\n├── Agent span\n├── Model span\n├── Tool span\n├── Git span\n├── CI span\n├── Evidence\n└── Resource / Project\n\nProject 成为上下文，而不是所有信息的父对象。\n```\n\n这允许 UI 同时回答：\n\n```text\n哪个项目？\n谁在做？\n一次什么执行？\n现在到了哪一步？\n用过什么模型/工具？\n产生什么 Git/CI 结果？\n依据是什么？\n这个事实有多新？\n```\n\n### 当前 projection 与 V3 的差异\n\n下面“当前”列只描述已从当前 UI surface 可以证明的能力，不把尚未逐行核验的 backend schema 当成事实。\n\n| Concept | 当前 Observer surface | Observer 3.0 | 理由 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Project | 一等公民 | 保留 | 仓库/工作域上下文 |\n| Project status | 有 | 改为 derived attention | 防止错误聚合 |\n| Git | 有展示需求 | 一等事实 | Commit/branch/dirty 应可追溯 |\n| CI | 有展示需求 | Delivery span + state | 接入 Execution 链 |\n| Usage/Token | aggregate panel | Measurement + Model span | 只有 source-reported 才出现 |\n| Governance | 独立 panel | Trust domain | 降低正常状态视觉噪声 |\n| Execution | 前端未见第一等 surface | **新增核心实体** | AI workflow 主轴 |\n| Trace | 未见完整 Trace UI | **新增** | 跨 Agent/Tool/Git/CI 关联 |\n| Span | 未见 | **新增** | 可表达阶段与持续时间 |\n| Event | UI 结构未以事件为主 | **新增/规范化** | Timeline 与 provenance |\n| Agent | 多作为 project metadata | **实体化** | 一个 Execution 可跨多个 Agent |\n| Model | usage 中隐含 | **实体化** | model call 与 token/cost/latency |\n| Tool | 未形成统一 domain | **实体化** | GitHub、shell、Harness 等 |\n| Resource | project-centric | **新增轻量 Resource** | repo/workspace/runtime context |\n| Metric | Aggregate | explicit observed/derived | 防止 UNKNOWN→0 |\n| Evidence | 真实性概念存在 | first-class reference | 所有关键结论可追根 |\n| Freshness | global transport/state | per-source + per-domain | last-good 不再产生视觉误导 |\n| Provenance | 隐式 | **显式** | 数据准确性的关键 |\n| Reason codes | UI 可能映射状态 | **统一** | Derived state 可解释 |\n\n### 推荐 JSON Schema 轮廓\n\n不是要求一次性把所有字段填满。原则是：**不存在的数据保持不存在/UNKNOWN，而不是编造。**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"3.0\",\n  \"revision\": \"829\",\n  \"generatedAt\": \"2026-08-16T00:00:00Z\",\n\n  \"transport\": {\n    \"mode\": \"LIVE\",\n    \"connected\": true,\n    \"lastHeartbeatAt\": \"2026-08-16T00:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"workflow-public-events\",\n      \"state\": \"healthy\",\n      \"observedAt\": \"2026-08-16T00:00:00Z\",\n      \"watermark\": \"...\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"projects\": [],\n\n  \"executions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"exec_...\",\n      \"projectId\": \"work-lab\",\n      \"state\": \"running\",\n      \"startedAt\": \"...\",\n      \"endedAt\": null,\n      \"rootSpanId\": \"span_...\",\n      \"currentSpanId\": \"span_...\",\n      \"reasonCodes\": [],\n      \"evidenceIds\": []\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"spans\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"span_...\",\n      \"executionId\": \"exec_...\",\n      \"parentSpanId\": null,\n      \"kind\": \"agent\",\n      \"name\": \"Codex\",\n      \"status\": \"running\",\n      \"startedAt\": \"...\",\n      \"endedAt\": null,\n      \"resourceIds\": [],\n      \"measurementIds\": [],\n      \"evidenceIds\": []\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"events\": [],\n  \"agents\": [],\n  \"models\": [],\n  \"tools\": [],\n  \"resources\": [],\n  \"deliveries\": [],\n  \"measurements\": [],\n  \"evidence\": [],\n\n  \"quality\": {\n    \"coverage\": null,\n    \"unknownCount\": 0,\n    \"malformedCount\": 0,\n    \"droppedCount\": 0,\n    \"duplicateCount\": 0\n  },\n\n  \"governance\": {}\n}\n```\n\n### Measurement 与 provenance\n\n不要简单写：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tokens\": 0\n}\n```\n\n应写：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"m_123\",\n  \"kind\": \"llm.tokens.input\",\n  \"value\": 18432,\n  \"unit\": \"token\",\n  \"sourceId\": \"usage-ledger\",\n  \"observedAt\": \"2026-08-16T01:32:10Z\",\n  \"mode\": \"observed\"\n}\n```\n\n没有 collector：\n\n```text\nmeasurement 不存在\n```\n\n而不是：\n\n```text\nvalue = 0\n```\n\nDerived 状态则必须能说明来源：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"state\": \"blocked\",\n  \"mode\": \"derived\",\n  \"reasonCodes\": [\"CI_FAILED\"],\n  \"derivedFrom\": [\"delivery:ci:9481\"]\n}\n```\n\n这一步会直接解决相当一部分“数据看起来不准”的问题。\n\n### Execution/Trace 数据关系\n\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    PROJECT ||--o{ EXECUTION : contains\n    EXECUTION ||--o{ SPAN : consists_of\n    EXECUTION ||--o{ EVENT : emits\n    EXECUTION }o--o{ EVIDENCE : supported_by\n\n    SPAN }o--|| AGENT : may_run_as\n    SPAN }o--|| MODEL : may_invoke\n    SPAN }o--|| TOOL : may_use\n    SPAN }o--o{ MEASUREMENT : measures\n    SPAN }o--o{ EVIDENCE : supported_by\n\n    PROJECT ||--o{ RESOURCE : owns\n    EXECUTION }o--o{ RESOURCE : runs_against\n    EXECUTION }o--o{ DELIVERY : produces\n\n    PROJECT {\n      string id\n      string name\n    }\n\n    EXECUTION {\n      string id\n      string projectId\n      string state\n      datetime startedAt\n      datetime endedAt\n    }\n\n    SPAN {\n      string id\n      string executionId\n      string parentSpanId\n      string kind\n      string status\n    }\n\n    EVENT {\n      string id\n      string executionId\n      datetime timestamp\n      string type\n    }\n\n    MEASUREMENT {\n      string id\n      string kind\n      number value\n      string sourceId\n      datetime observedAt\n    }\n\n    EVIDENCE {\n      string id\n      string sourceId\n      datetime observedAt\n    }\n```\n\n### 后端 Projection 重构\n\n不建议新建外部数据库，也不建议引入 OpenTelemetry Collector。\n\n架构采用“OTel-like semantics, WORK-LAB-native transport”：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    C1[\"Workflow Event Collector\"]\n    C2[\"Evidence Collector\"]\n    C3[\"Git Facts Collector\"]\n    C4[\"CI Facts Collector\"]\n    C5[\"Usage Collector\"]\n\n    C1 --> N[\"Normalizer\"]\n    C2 --> N\n    C3 --> N\n    C4 --> N\n    C5 --> N\n\n    N --> SAFE[\"Sensitive-field allowlist\"]\n    SAFE --> CE[\"Canonical Observer Events\"]\n\n    CE --> CORR[\"Execution Correlator\"]\n    CORR --> PB[\"Projection Builder V3\"]\n\n    PB --> EX[\"Execution Projection\"]\n    PB --> PR[\"Project Projection\"]\n    PB --> TR[\"Trust Projection\"]\n    PB --> AGG[\"Derived Aggregates\"]\n\n    EX --> SNAP[\"Snapshot V3\"]\n    PR --> SNAP\n    TR --> SNAP\n    AGG --> SNAP\n\n    SNAP --> VAL[\"Schema Validation\"]\n    VAL --> API[\"Existing loopback GET/SSE boundary\"]\n```\n\n**Collectors** 只读，不改变 workflow source。\n\n**Normalizer** 将异构上游字段统一为 Observer 内部事实。\n\n**Execution Correlator** 尽量利用已有 event/correlation/task IDs；如果源端没有可靠关联键，必须标成 `uncorrelated`，不能用时间接近程度偷偷制造一条 Trace。\n\n**Projection Builder** 只投影，不写回 Ledger。\n\n**Derived Aggregates** 是唯一允许计算“health/attention”的位置；renderer 不自行定义第二套业务规则。\n\n**Schema Validation** 保持 fail-closed。\n\n### 可观测性对象逐项结论\n\n| 对象 | Observer 3.0 决策 |\n|---|---|\n| Execution | 必须成为核心 |\n| Trace | 使用 Execution 作为 WORK-LAB trace boundary |\n| Span | 必须支持 Agent/Model/Tool/Git/CI/Evidence 类型 |\n| Event | 必须保留离散时间事件 |\n| Metric | 作为有 source/provenance 的 measurement |\n| Resource | Project/Repo/Workspace/Runtime context |\n| Log | 不建议直接复制普通日志系统；仅投影允许公开的 event/evidence |\n| Prompt/Response | **明确不进入 Observer** |\n| Raw Tool I/O | **不进入** |\n| Provider secrets | **不进入** |\n\n### 开源对标矩阵\n\n这里建议学习的是产品/架构范式，**不是把这些平台嵌入 WORK-LAB**。由于本轮未完成这些项目 2026-08-16 最新版本官方文档的再次在线逐页核验，表中仅使用其稳定的、长期公开的核心架构范式，不对最新版本 feature list 作断言。\n\n| 项目 | 最值得借鉴 | WORK-LAB 应落地 | 不应该照搬 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **SigNoz** | Trace-first observability、从摘要钻取到 span | Execution waterfall、时间范围、status→trace drill-down | ClickHouse/完整 APM backend、基础设施中心的信息架构 |\n| **HyperDX** | Timeline、logs/trace context correlation | Unified Activity Stream、点击事件进入 execution context | Session Replay、大规模日志搜索后端 |\n| **Langfuse** | LLM Trace/Observation、generation/tool semantics、usage | Model/Tool Span、token/cost provenance | Prompt/Response 存储、dataset/eval 产品域、云 ingestion |\n| **Perses** | Dashboard-as-code、schema/component abstraction | Declarative view definitions、schema versioning | 第一阶段做插件生态或复杂 plugin runtime |\n| **Grafana** | Time range、panel/query conceptual separation、drill-down | time scope、inspect evidence、可复用 visualization primitive | 任意 panel builder、card soup、多数据源配置复杂度 |\n| **OneUptime** | Health/SLO/incident 信息层次 | Attention/Reason Codes、异常优先 | on-call、incident write actions、status page publishing |\n| **OpenTelemetry 思维** | Trace/Span/Event/Metric/Resource 统一语言 | 作为内部 Projection 语义参考 | 不必引入 Collector/SDK/外部服务，只为“OTel 化”而 OTel 化 |\n\n最终设计原则应该是：\n\n> **Langfuse 的 Execution 语义 + SigNoz 的 Trace drill-down + HyperDX 的事件上下文 + Perses 的 schema 思维 + Linear/Vercel 级别的视觉克制。**\n\n而不是：\n\n> “把六个产品首页拼起来。”\n\n## UI_DESIGN_SPEC.md — 全量界面重新设计\n\n### 产品信息架构\n\nObserver 3.0 只保留五个一级入口：\n\n```text\nOverview\nExecutions\nProjects\nDelivery\nTrust\n```\n\nGovernance 不再与 Project/Token 平级抢夺首屏，而归入 Trust。\n\nToken 不再单独成为一级导航，而属于 Executions/AI Runtime 中的 Measurement。\n\nGit/CI/Artifact 统一进 Delivery。\n\n这比现在的信息组织少，但实际可观察的信息更多。\n\n### Overview\n\n首屏必须在 **3 秒** 内回答：\n\n```text\n系统的数据连接可靠吗？\n现在有多少执行正在运行？\n哪里需要注意？\n哪个项目受影响？\n最近发生了什么？\n```\n\n建议结构：\n\n```text\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ WORK-LAB / Observer                         LIVE   READ ONLY    Fresh 8s     │\n├──────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│              │                                                              │\n│ Overview     │  SYSTEM                                                      │\n│ Executions   │  ● Live    Coverage 100%   Rev 829    Sources 14/14         │\n│ Projects     │                                                              │\n│ Delivery     ├──────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────┤\n│ Trust        │ ACTIVE EXECUTIONS                    │ ATTENTION             │\n│              │                                      │                       │\n│              │ ● Codex  WORK-LAB         18m       │ 1  CI failed          │\n│              │   Observer refactor                  │    DESIGN-LAB         │\n│              │                                      │                       │\n│              │ ● Hermes DESIGN-LAB       4m        │ 0  stale sources      │\n│              │                                      │                       │\n│              ├──────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────┤\n│              │ PROJECTS                                                     │\n│              │                                                              │\n│              │ WORK-LAB      RUNNING    main a71bc82    CI PASS    8s      │\n│              │ DESIGN-LAB    BLOCKED    main e91cc31    CI FAIL   12s      │\n│              │ ArcheAxis     IDLE       main b661922    UNKNOWN   38s      │\n│              │                                                              │\n│              ├──────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────┤\n│              │ ACTIVITY                             │ AI USAGE              │\n│              │                                      │                       │\n│              │ 14:28 Codex span started             │ only when observed    │\n│              │ 14:27 commit detected                │ token / cache / cost  │\n│              │ 14:27 CI queued                      │                       │\n│              │                                      │                       │\n├──────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────┤\n│ READ ONLY · Last verified 14:28:31 · loopback                              │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n注意：**首屏不应该有六个巨大 KPI 数字卡。**\n\n最大的视觉主体是：\n\n1. 当前 Execution；\n2. Attention；\n3. Project table；\n4. 最近 Activity。\n\n### Executions\n\n这是 Observer 3.0 的产品核心。\n\n```text\nEXECUTION / exec_829\nWORK-LAB · Running · Started 18m ago\n\n┌─────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│             │  0s        4s        8s       12s       16s                │\n│ Hermes      │  ███████                                                     │\n│ Codex       │        █████████████████                                     │\n│ DeepSeek    │             ███                                              │\n│ Git         │                         ██                                   │\n│ CI          │                            █████████                         │\n│ Evidence    │                                      ██                     │\n├─────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Selected span                                                               │\n│ Codex · RUNNING                                                             │\n│ Project: WORK-LAB        Source: workflow-public-events                    │\n│ Started: 14:10:32        Last observed: 14:28:27                           │\n│ Evidence: ev_9281, ev_9282                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n这是 waterfall，不是“炫酷拓扑图”。\n\n不应默认使用 force graph，因为项目只有少量节点时 graph 很漂亮，大量 executions 后会迅速变成毛线团。\n\n### Projects\n\nProject 页面专门回答**静态上下文 + 当前事实**：\n\n```text\nProject        Attention   Active   Git          CI       Freshness\nWORK-LAB       RUNNING     2        a71bc82      PASS     8s\nDESIGN-LAB     BLOCKED     1        e91cc31      FAIL     12s\nArcheAxis      IDLE        0        b661922      —        38s\n```\n\n点击项目后：\n\n```text\nSummary\nActive executions\nRecent executions\nGit state\nDelivery\nEvidence\nSource health\n```\n\nProject Card 只允许出现在 Detail/Overview 的有限场景，**不再把整个页面做成卡片墙。**\n\n### Delivery\n\n统一：\n\n```text\nGit\nCI\nGate\nArtifact\n```\n\n而不是分别散落在多个 Project cards。\n\n```text\nPROJECT      BRANCH     HEAD       TREE     CI        ARTIFACT     VERIFIED\nWORK-LAB     main       a71bc82    CLEAN    PASS      build-829    8s\nDESIGN-LAB   main       e91cc31    DIRTY    FAILED    —            12s\n```\n\n### Trust\n\n这是 WORK-LAB Observer 与普通 Dashboard 的核心差异。\n\n```text\nDATA TRUST\n\nTransport\nLIVE\n\nLast verified\n8s\n\nSource coverage\n14 / 14\n\nProjection revision\n829\n\nWriter watermark\n...\n\nUnknown facts\n3\n\nMalformed events\n0\n\nDropped\n0\n\nDuplicate\n2\n```\n\n下面才是：\n\n```text\nGovernance\nRules\nSkills\nAdapters\nMemory\n```\n\n正常项降低视觉权重，异常项才上浮。\n\n### 色彩系统\n\n建议 Dark-first，但 Light 必须是一等公民。\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --wl-bg-canvas: #0b0f14;\n  --wl-surface-1: #11161d;\n  --wl-surface-2: #171d26;\n  --wl-surface-hover: #1b222c;\n\n  --wl-border-subtle: #26303c;\n  --wl-border-strong: #394657;\n\n  --wl-text-primary: #f3f6fa;\n  --wl-text-secondary: #b4becb;\n  --wl-text-muted: #7f8b9b;\n\n  --wl-accent: #6ea8fe;\n\n  --wl-status-success: #3ddc97;\n  --wl-status-running: #67c5ff;\n  --wl-status-warning: #f4c95d;\n  --wl-status-critical: #ff6b6b;\n  --wl-status-unknown: #8894a3;\n  --wl-status-stale: #d0a85c;\n\n  --wl-radius-sm: 6px;\n  --wl-radius-md: 10px;\n  --wl-radius-lg: 14px;\n\n  --wl-space-1: 4px;\n  --wl-space-2: 8px;\n  --wl-space-3: 12px;\n  --wl-space-4: 16px;\n  --wl-space-6: 24px;\n  --wl-space-8: 32px;\n\n  --wl-motion-fast: 120ms;\n  --wl-motion-normal: 180ms;\n}\n```\n\n这些色值是**设计提案**，不是对当前 CSS 的描述。\n\n### 排版\n\n不引入外部 Web Font：\n\n```css\nfont-family:\n  -apple-system,\n  BlinkMacSystemFont,\n  \"Segoe UI\",\n  sans-serif;\n\nfont-family:\n  ui-monospace,\n  SFMono-Regular,\n  Menlo,\n  Consolas,\n  monospace;\n```\n\n视觉层级：\n\n| Role | 推荐 |\n|---|---|\n| Page title | 20–24px / 600 |\n| Section title | 15–17px / 600 |\n| Card/domain title | 13–15px / 600 |\n| Body/data | 13–14px |\n| Metadata | 11–12px |\n| Large metric | 26–32px，仅真正关键 aggregate |\n| SHA/branch/revision | monospace 11–13px |\n\n不要使用“所有东西都是 bold”来制造 hierarchy。\n\n### Card 规则\n\n允许成为 Card 的只有：\n\n```text\nExecution summary\nAttention\nAI telemetry domain\nTrust domain\nProject detail summary\nCritical alert\n```\n\n下面这些不能单独变成 Card：\n\n```text\n一个 Token 数字\n一个 SHA\n一个 branch\n一个 freshness 值\n一个 source count\n一个 CI badge\n```\n\n它们属于 row/cell/metric group。\n\n这会立即消灭“Card Soup”。\n\n### 状态规则\n\n任何 status 必须由：\n\n```text\nIcon + Text + Color\n```\n\n共同表达。\n\n例如：\n\n```text\n● RUNNING\n✓ PASS\n! WARNING\n× FAILED\n? UNKNOWN\n◷ STALE\n```\n\n不能只靠绿/红颜色。\n\n### Motion\n\n允许：\n\n```text\nhover     120ms\nselection 120–180ms\ndrawer    180ms\nsubtle live indicator\n```\n\n禁止：\n\n```text\nglow\nneon\nshimmer\nfloating cards\ninfinite gradient\nanimated chart decoration\npage entrance spectacle\n```\n\n`prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` 时关闭非必要动画。\n\n### Accessibility\n\n当前 `accessibility.js` 已有 live region、keyboard navigation 等基础，因此重构应继承，而不是另造一套。fileciteturn0file6L20-L41\n\n验收目标：\n\n```text\nWCAG 2.2 AA\nkeyboard-only usable\nvisible :focus-visible\nstatus not color-only\naria-live only for meaningful transitions\ntable headers semantic\nSVG charts have textual summary\nprefers-reduced-motion\nminimum hit target\n```\n\n### Native Charts\n\n当前 `charts.js` 走 native SVG 路线，这是正确的方向。\n\n不建议为了“高级感”引入：\n\n```text\nChart.js\nECharts\nHighcharts\nD3\n```\n\n除非后续出现 native SVG 无法合理承担的复杂 visualization。\n\nTrace Waterfall 也可以纯 SVG/CSS Grid 完成。\n\n### Responsive\n\n| Width | Layout |\n|---|---|\n| ≥ 1920 | 240px Sidebar + 12-column content |\n| 1600–1919 | 220px Sidebar + 12-column |\n| 1280–1599 | 200px/collapsible + 8-column |\n| 1024–1279 | collapsed nav + 1/2-column |\n| Compact window | dedicated compact view |\n\n最低重点截图：\n\n```text\n2560×1440\n1920×1080\n1440×900\n1366×768\n1024×768\n```\n\nCompact 不是 Full 的 CSS scale：\n\n```text\nWORK-LAB                         LIVE\n\n2 active · 1 attention\n\nWORK-LAB\nCODEX · Running                       8s\n\nDESIGN-LAB\nCI Failed                            12s\n\nCoverage                            100%\nLast verified                         8s\n```\n\n## TASKPACK_WL-OBS-3.0.yaml 与 CHANGED_FILES_PROPOSAL.md\n\n以下 YAML 可直接作为 DeepSeek Harness 主任务包。**Gate Zero 故意要求再次用 GitHub/main 文件事实锁定未完成审计项；Harness 不得拿本报告中的“建议字段”冒充仓库已有事实。**\n\n```yaml\ntaskpack:\n  id: WL-OBS-3.0\n  title: WORK-LAB Observer 3.0 — READ-ONLY AI Workflow Control Plane\n  baseline:\n    repository: DTALEX66/WORK-LAB\n    branch: main\n    sha: 5fc107bbfe8a09e917b5f991e4c3f013d6a5117e\n    verified_at: \"2026-08-16\"\n  priority: P0\n  mode: bounded-refactor\n\n  objective:\n    - Upgrade Observer from project/KPI dashboard to execution-centric read-only control plane\n    - Preserve all existing truth, security, local-first and fail-closed contracts\n    - Redesign the complete information architecture and visual system\n    - Improve data provenance, freshness and explainability\n    - Keep Vanilla JS + Tauri unless a new dependency passes explicit architecture review\n\n  invariants:\n    mandatory:\n      - READ_ONLY\n      - GET_ONLY_FRONTEND\n      - LOOPBACK_ONLY_LIVE\n      - SNAPSHOT_VALIDATION\n      - LAST_GOOD\n      - STALE_IS_NOT_LIVE\n      - UNKNOWN_IS_NOT_ZERO\n      - NO_FIXTURE_AS_PRODUCTION\n      - SSE_SECURITY\n      - FAIL_CLOSED\n      - NO_PROMPT_BODY\n      - NO_RESPONSE_BODY\n      - NO_SECRET_FIELDS\n      - NO_EXTERNAL_HOSTED_SERVICE\n\n  forbidden:\n    - write_to_workflow_ledger\n    - approve_actions\n    - execute_tasks\n    - retry_tasks\n    - rollback_tasks\n    - fabricate_metrics\n    - infer_live_from_ui_state\n    - replace_unknown_with_zero\n    - add_cloud_telemetry\n    - add_external_database\n    - introduce_react_or_vue_without_architecture_gate\n    - force_push\n    - reset_user_changes\n    - merge_or_push_without_explicit_authorization\n\n  phases:\n\n    - id: gate-zero\n      name: Lock cloud baseline and complete evidence inventory\n      priority: P0\n      effort: medium\n      tasks:\n        - verify current HEAD still equals baseline or record new baseline\n        - enumerate every remote branch\n        - record ahead/behind against main\n        - enumerate open PRs\n        - enumerate GitHub Actions workflows and current main check-runs\n        - inventory 00-governance\n        - inventory 10-workflow\n        - inventory 30-observer\n        - inventory observer schemas/src/web/src-tauri/tests/docs\n        - inventory CI configuration\n        - locate all AGENTS.md and repository-local instructions\n        - compare uploaded frontend snapshot with main blobs by SHA\n        - extract current CSS custom properties and hard-coded colors\n        - detect existing Playwright/visual regression infrastructure\n      outputs:\n        - docs/observer/OBSERVER_3_BASELINE.md\n        - docs/observer/CSS_CURRENT_INVENTORY.md\n      gate:\n        - no repository edits before instructions are read\n        - current branch and baseline SHA recorded\n        - unresolved source-of-truth ambiguities listed\n\n    - id: truth-contract\n      name: Freeze truth and security contract\n      priority: P0\n      effort: medium\n      tasks:\n        - document API GET-only contract\n        - document LIVE validation rules\n        - document snapshot schema validation\n        - document last-good/stale/offline transitions\n        - document SSE trust boundary\n        - create truth regression tests before refactoring\n      protected_behavior:\n        - api.js\n        - state.js\n        - live transport validation\n        - snapshot validation\n      tests:\n        - unknown_never_becomes_zero\n        - stale_never_becomes_live\n        - offline_never_uses_fixture\n        - failed_refresh_retains_last_good\n        - invalid_snapshot_is_rejected\n        - non_loopback_live_endpoint_is_rejected\n      gate:\n        - all pre-existing tests pass\n        - all new truth regression tests pass\n\n    - id: projection-v3\n      name: Introduce execution-centric projection\n      priority: P0\n      effort: high\n      tasks:\n        - define dashboard-projection-v3 schema\n        - define canonical Observer Event normalization\n        - define Execution identity/correlation rules\n        - define Span kinds\n        - define Measurement provenance contract\n        - define source/domain freshness\n        - define explicit derived-state reason codes\n        - preserve evidence sanitization\n        - provide compatibility adapter from current projection\n      entities:\n        - Project\n        - Execution\n        - Span\n        - Event\n        - Agent\n        - Model\n        - Tool\n        - Resource\n        - Delivery\n        - Measurement\n        - Evidence\n        - DataQuality\n      safety:\n        span_attributes: allowlist_only\n        forbidden_fields:\n          - prompt\n          - response\n          - authorization\n          - api_key\n          - password\n          - secret\n          - raw_tool_input\n          - raw_tool_output\n      gate:\n        - schema tests pass\n        - malformed events fail closed\n        - no sensitive fixture leaks\n        - uncorrelated events remain explicitly uncorrelated\n        - no heuristic trace fabrication\n\n    - id: frontend-model\n      name: Create one frontend semantic model\n      priority: P0\n      effort: high\n      tasks:\n        - extract shared status meta\n        - create selectors\n        - create freshness selectors\n        - create Observer V3 view model\n        - move derived UI decisions out of fusion renderer\n        - make all views consume the same selectors\n      gate:\n        - Project state has one canonical frontend mapping\n        - Delivery state has one mapping\n        - Trust state has one mapping\n        - renderer cannot convert null into zero\n\n    - id: information-architecture\n      name: Replace dashboard IA\n      priority: P1\n      effort: high\n      navigation:\n        - Overview\n        - Executions\n        - Projects\n        - Delivery\n        - Trust\n      remove_or_merge:\n        - duplicated Project Overview\n        - Runtime Matrix duplication\n        - Project Health duplication\n        - standalone token dashboard as top-level concept\n      gate:\n        - first screen answers live/trust/active/attention/project/recent-event\n        - no duplicated project status surfaces\n\n    - id: visual-system\n      name: Build WORK-LAB Observer design system\n      priority: P1\n      effort: high\n      tasks:\n        - create semantic tokens\n        - unify dark/light themes\n        - rebuild shell/sidebar/topbar\n        - implement typography scale\n        - implement status components\n        - implement domain cards\n        - implement tables\n        - implement empty/unknown/stale/offline states\n        - implement responsive layout\n        - implement compact mode\n      constraints:\n        - no external font dependency\n        - no neon\n        - no card-per-number\n        - no status encoded by color alone\n      gate:\n        - dark and light parity\n        - 1366x768 has no page-level overflow\n        - long project names do not break layout\n        - sha and branch remain readable\n\n    - id: execution-ui\n      name: Build execution observability\n      priority: P0\n      effort: high\n      tasks:\n        - execution list\n        - trace waterfall\n        - selected span details\n        - activity timeline\n        - agent/model/tool identity\n        - evidence links\n        - source and freshness indicators\n        - token/cost/latency only when observed\n      gate:\n        - no invented spans\n        - no invented progress\n        - missing model data renders unknown/not-observed\n        - selected span is keyboard reachable\n\n    - id: delivery-trust\n      name: Consolidate Delivery and Trust\n      priority: P1\n      effort: medium\n      tasks:\n        - combine git/ci/artifact facts into Delivery\n        - expose evidence coverage\n        - expose per-source freshness\n        - expose projection revision\n        - expose malformed/dropped/duplicate/unknown where available\n        - move governance health under Trust\n      gate:\n        - dirty tree is distinct from CI failure\n        - stale is distinct from failed\n        - unknown is distinct from healthy\n\n    - id: accessibility\n      name: Accessibility parity and upgrade\n      priority: P1\n      effort: medium\n      tasks:\n        - preserve existing keyboard navigation\n        - preserve live-region semantics\n        - add focus-visible\n        - add table semantics\n        - add textual SVG summaries\n        - support prefers-reduced-motion\n      gate:\n        - full primary workflow keyboard navigable\n        - status not color-only\n        - no focus trap\n        - meaningful dynamic state has accessible text\n\n    - id: validation\n      name: Engineering and visual gates\n      priority: P0\n      effort: high\n      tasks:\n        - run repository-defined lint\n        - run repository-defined unit tests\n        - run schema tests\n        - run observer backend tests\n        - run frontend renderer tests\n        - run Tauri build/check\n        - run accessibility tests if infrastructure exists\n        - capture visual baselines\n      screenshots:\n        - observer-overview-dark-2560x1440.png\n        - observer-overview-dark-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-overview-light-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-overview-dark-1366x768.png\n        - observer-execution-dark-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-trust-dark-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-stale-dark-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-offline-dark-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-empty-usage-dark-1920x1080.png\n        - observer-compact-dark.png\n      gate:\n        - all required tests green\n        - no truth regression\n        - visual baseline reviewed\n        - changed-file scope audited\n\n  final_evidence:\n    required:\n      - baseline_sha\n      - final_sha\n      - changed_files\n      - tests_executed\n      - test_results\n      - screenshots\n      - schema_diff\n      - remaining_gaps\n      - rollback_steps\n\n  done_when:\n    - Observer is still read-only\n    - no fake telemetry exists\n    - Overview is not card soup\n    - Execution is a first-class observable object\n    - every volatile metric has source/freshness semantics\n    - UNKNOWN is preserved\n    - last-good semantics remain intact\n    - dark/light/compact modes pass\n    - accessibility has no known regression\n    - repository-defined tests pass\n```\n\n### CHANGED_FILES_PROPOSAL.md\n\n以下是**提案**；Gate Zero 发现仓库已有同等文件时应合并，不重复造目录。\n\n| Path | Action | 主要函数/内容 | Priority | Effort | 回滚 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/schemas/*projection*v3*.json` | 新增/升级 | Execution-centric contract | P0 | 高 | 保留 V2 schema |\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/src/observer_runtime.py` | 谨慎修改 | 接入 V3 projection builder，不改安全边界 | P0 | 高 | feature switch 回 V2 |\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/src/*normalizer*.py` | 新增或整合 | canonical event normalization | P0 | 高 | 停用 V3 adapter |\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/src/*projection*v3*.py` | 新增 | Execution/Span/Trust projection | P0 | 高 | V2 builder 保留 |\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/src/*evidence*.py` | 最小修改 | allowlist / provenance refs | P0 | 中 | revert isolated patch |\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/web/scripts/api.js` | **行为冻结** | 只做 V3 schema compatibility（确需时） | P0 | 低 | 单文件 revert |\n| `30-observer/work-lab-observer/web/scripts/state.js` | **行为冻结** | last-good/stale/offline 不变 | P0 | 低 | 单文件 revert |\n| `.../web/scripts/app.js` | 修改 | view routing/composition only | P1 | 中 | V2/V3 UI switch |\n| `.../web/scripts/fusion-v3.js` | **大重构** | 删除重复 project surfaces，变 shell/composer | P0 | 高 | legacy fusion retained |\n| `.../web/scripts/render-v3.js` | 重构 | truth-aware primitives | P0 | 中 | incremental revert |\n| `.../web/scripts/render.js` | 冻结 | Legacy compatibility | P2 | 低 | 无需 |\n| `.../web/scripts/model/selectors.js` | 新增 | canonical frontend semantics | P0 | 中 | V3 imports revert |\n| `.../web/scripts/model/view-model.js` | 新增 | raw projection → UI model | P0 | 高 | V2 renderer path |\n| `.../web/scripts/model/freshness.js` | 新增 | source/domain age | P0 | 中 | V2 global status |\n| `.../web/scripts/components/*` | 新增 | reusable semantic components | P1 | 高 | revert view-by-view |\n| `.../web/scripts/views/overview.js` | 新增 | Command Center | P1 | 高 | V2 route |\n| `.../web/scripts/views/executions.js` | 新增 | trace/waterfall | P0 | 高 | hide route |\n| `.../web/scripts/views/projects.js` | 新增 | facts/project detail | P1 | 中 | V2 route |\n| `.../web/scripts/views/delivery.js` | 新增 | Git/CI/Artifact | P1 | 中 | V2 route |\n| `.../web/scripts/views/trust.js` | 新增 | freshness/coverage/governance | P0 | 中 | V2 route |\n| `.../web/scripts/charts.js` | 改良 | native SVG only | P2 | 中 | revert chart patch |\n| `.../web/scripts/accessibility.js` | 兼容升级 | focus/live region/navigation | P1 | 中 | focused revert |\n| `.../web/styles/tokens.css` | 新增/整合 | semantic token SSOT | P1 | 中 | old stylesheet path |\n| `.../web/styles/base.css` | 新增/整合 | reset/type | P1 | 低 | revert |\n| `.../web/styles/layout.css` | 新增/整合 | shell/grid/responsive | P1 | 中 | revert |\n| `.../web/styles/components.css` | 新增/整合 | shared component styling | P1 | 中 | revert |\n| `.../web/styles/views.css` | 新增/整合 | page-only rules | P1 | 中 | revert |\n| `.../tests/*projection*v3*` | 新增 | schema/projection/truth tests | P0 | 高 | 测试文件无运行风险 |\n| `.../tests/*frontend*` | 新增/增强 | renderer/selectors/states | P0 | 中 | 无运行风险 |\n| `.../src-tauri/*` | 默认冻结 | 仅适配资源入口/窗口需求 | P2 | 低 | 单文件 revert |\n| `.../docs/observer/COMMAND_CENTER_3_DESIGN.md` | 新增/合并 | Architecture/design | P1 | 低 | docs revert |\n| `.github/workflows/*observer*` | 条件修改 | 仅在现有 CI 模式允许时加 gate | P1 | 中 | workflow revert |\n\n**禁止“顺手重构”的文件域：**\n\n```text\n00-governance\n10-workflow execution semantics\nledger writers\napproval path\nunrelated project adapters\nunrelated CI\n```\n\n除非 Projection V3 明确需要新增**公开、脱敏、只读字段**，且对应 contract/test 同步修改。\n\n### 测试矩阵\n\n| Gate | 必须验证 |\n|---|---|\n| Truth | `null != 0`、`UNKNOWN != healthy`、`STALE != LIVE` |\n| Last-good | refresh failure 保留最后可信 projection |\n| Transport | 非 loopback LIVE 拒绝 |\n| Snapshot | malformed/unsupported schema fail closed |\n| Execution | 正确 parent/child correlation |\n| Correlation | 缺可靠 key 时保留 uncorrelated |\n| Privacy | prompt/response/credential fixtures 必须被拒绝 |\n| Project | long names、missing CI、dirty tree、detached/no SHA |\n| Usage | no sample、partial sample、real zero 均区别正确 |\n| Delivery | `FAIL`、`RUNNING`、`UNKNOWN` 独立 |\n| Trust | source stale / global live 可同时表达 |\n| Renderer | empty / one / many executions |\n| Accessibility | keyboard、focus、ARIA、status text |\n| Responsive | 2560、1920、1440、1366、1024 |\n| Compact | 独立 IA |\n| Tauri | existing build/check |\n| Existing suite | 仓库原有测试不得回归 |\n\n## 风险、回滚、视觉验证与最终决策\n\n**本节可直接保存为 `VISUAL_VERIFICATION_PLAN.md`；同时包含整体风险与最终实施建议。**\n\n### Visual Verification Baseline\n\n| Baseline | Resolution | Theme | 必须证明 |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| `overview-dark-ultrawide` | 2560×1440 | Dark | 高宽屏不空、不极端拉伸 |\n| `overview-dark-standard` | 1920×1080 | Dark | 主基线 |\n| `overview-light-standard` | 1920×1080 | Light | light parity |\n| `overview-dark-laptop` | 1440×900 | Dark | 常用桌面 |\n| `overview-dark-small` | 1366×768 | Dark | 无整体横向滚动 |\n| `overview-1024` | 1024×768 | Dark | sidebar collapse |\n| `execution-running` | 1920×1080 | Dark | Waterfall |\n| `execution-failed` | 1920×1080 | Dark | failure/reason |\n| `trust-live` | 1920×1080 | Dark | source/freshness |\n| `stale-last-good` | 1920×1080 | Dark | old value 不冒充 live |\n| `offline-last-good` | 1920×1080 | Dark | offline + last verified |\n| `offline-empty` | 1920×1080 | Dark | 无可信 observation |\n| `usage-unknown` | 1920×1080 | Dark | 不出现 0 token |\n| `long-project-name` | 1366×768 | Dark | layout stability |\n| `many-executions` | 1920×1080 | Dark | density/scroll behavior |\n| `compact` | 实际 Tauri compact size | Dark | 常驻小窗 |\n\nPlaywright 只在**仓库已经使用或已有浏览器自动化依赖**时优先复用。若现有栈没有 Playwright，不应为了 Observer 3.0 第一阶段新增一整套 Node/browser 基础设施；可以使用现有 Tauri/browser screenshot mechanism 建 baseline，然后单独评估是否值得引入。\n\n### 视觉验收不是“截图看起来漂亮”\n\n每张截图必须同时过以下检查：\n\n| 类型 | Gate |\n|---|---|\n| Hierarchy | 第一视觉焦点是 active/attention，而不是装饰 KPI |\n| Density | 关键事实一屏可见，但无 scalar-card soup |\n| Consistency | 同一状态只能有一套 status semantics |\n| Truth | UNKNOWN / STALE / OFFLINE 显著而克制 |\n| Typography | SHA/branch/code 与普通文字层级正确 |\n| Grid | panel 基线与间距统一 |\n| Responsive | 无 page-level overflow |\n| Color | status 不是纯色彩编码 |\n| Motion | screenshot state 不依赖动画 |\n| Light/Dark | 信息优先级相同 |\n| Empty | “No observation” 不写成 0 |\n| Data trust | 当前 observation 的 age/source 可找到 |\n\n### 主要风险与回滚计划\n\n| 风险 | Severity | 触发条件 | 控制措施 | 回滚 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| V3 schema 与现有 projection 不兼容 | 高 | frontend 读不到字段 | V2/V3 compatibility adapter | 切回 V2 renderer |\n| Correlation 错误制造假 Trace | **最高** | 仅凭时间猜 parent | 必须用可靠 ID；否则 uncorrelated | 禁用 correlator |\n| UI 重构破坏 last-good | **最高** | error 时 state 被清空 | state truth regression tests | restore frozen `state.js` |\n| LIVE 被前端猜测 | **最高** | badge 自己判 LIVE | transport contract test | restore frozen `api.js` |\n| Sensitive attributes 泄漏 | **最高** | span 捕获 raw args | allowlist + negative fixtures | 关闭 V3 span attribute |\n| Derived health 误导 | 高 | renderer 自己聚合 | derived state 只在 projection/selectors | 回到 raw facts |\n| 双 renderer 长期并存 | 中 | V2 永不退役 | migration deadline + parity gate | 保留 V2 到完成，不无限维护 |\n| Vanilla JS 模块过度碎片化 | 中 | 每个 DOM 小元素一个文件 | domain-level components only | 合并无复用模块 |\n| CSS Token migration 引发全局回归 | 中 | old selectors cascade | tokens first、view-by-view migration | restore previous stylesheet |\n| Waterfall 性能 | 中 | 数百 span DOM | viewport/compact row strategy | 简化 detail rendering |\n| Light mode 质量下降 | 中 | dark-only 开发 | visual baseline gate | rollback theme patch |\n| `main` 无保护 | 中 | 未经 gate 合并 | GitHub Ruleset | repository admin rollback |\n\n### 推荐的迁移方式\n\n绝对不要：\n\n```text\n删掉 V2\n→ 一口气重写 backend\n→ 一口气重写 frontend\n→ 最后一起调试\n```\n\n应该：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    B[\"Baseline / Truth Tests\"]\n    S[\"Projection V3 schema\"]\n    A[\"V2 → V3 compatibility\"]\n    M[\"Frontend view model\"]\n    O[\"New Overview\"]\n    X[\"Executions\"]\n    D[\"Delivery / Trust\"]\n    V[\"Visual parity\"]\n    C[\"Cutover\"]\n    R[\"Retire duplicated V2 surfaces\"]\n\n    B --> S --> A --> M --> O --> X --> D --> V --> C --> R\n```\n\n这样任何阶段都能回到：\n\n```text\nmain baseline\n+\nV2 projection\n+\ncurrent renderer\n```\n\n而不是把 Observer 一次性推到不可用状态。\n\n### 需要向开发者确认的问题\n\n| Role | 必须问的问题 |\n|---|---|\n| Workflow/backend owner | 上游目前有没有稳定的 `execution_id` / correlation id？ |\n| Workflow/backend owner | Agent→Agent delegation 是否有 parent relationship？ |\n| Workflow/backend owner | 哪些 public events 能安全暴露 model/tool identity？ |\n| Backend | freshness 当前是全局还是每 source 都已有 watermark？ |\n| Backend | evidence envelope 是否已有 stable evidence ID？ |\n| Backend | Git/CI/usage facts 的 authoritative source 分别是什么？ |\n| Backend | “真实 0 token”和“没有 token observation”目前是否可区分？ |\n| Backend | 是否已有 execution-like projection，只是前端没使用？ |\n| Frontend | `render.js` 是否还有正式 production caller？ |\n| Frontend | `render-v3.js` 与 `fusion-v3.js` 当前职责边界是否有文档 contract？ |\n| Frontend | Compact View 的实际 Tauri window constraint 是什么？ |\n| Frontend | 当前 CSS 是否存在正式 design token source？ |\n| Frontend | 是否已有 screenshot/Playwright infrastructure？ |\n| Tauri owner | CSP、asset loading、window navigation 当前有哪些限制？ |\n| Repo owner | `main` 未保护是有意策略还是尚未配置？ |\n| CI owner | Observer 的 required checks 应包括哪些 existing commands？ |\n\nHarness 能从代码直接得到答案的问题，不应该让它去问人；只有 contract/ownership 意图无法从仓库推导时才需要沟通。\n\n### 六份最终交付物对应关系\n\n| Deliverable | 本报告中的完整内容 |\n|---|---|\n| `WORK-LAB_OBSERVER_3_AUDIT_REPORT.md` | Executive Summary、云端仓库状态、当前架构、数据流、P0/P1/P2、证据 |\n| `PROJECTION_SCHEMA_DIFF.md` | “Observer 3.0 数据模型与目标架构”全部内容 |\n| `UI_DESIGN_SPEC.md` | “全量界面重新设计”全部内容 |\n| `TASKPACK_WL-OBS-3.0.yaml` | 上文 YAML，可直接保存执行 |\n| `CHANGED_FILES_PROPOSAL.md` | 文件变更表、函数职责、priority/effort/rollback |\n| `VISUAL_VERIFICATION_PLAN.md` | baseline、resolution/state matrix、视觉 gate、rollback |\n\n### 最终产品架构判断\n\nWORK-LAB Observer 当前最有价值的东西并不是现有 Dashboard，而是已经形成的这些约束：\n\n```text\nREAD ONLY\nGET ONLY\nLOCAL / LOOPBACK\nLAST GOOD\nFAIL CLOSED\nSNAPSHOT VALIDATION\nEXPLICIT LIVE\nUNKNOWN REMAINS UNKNOWN\nEVIDENCE DRIVEN\n```\n\nfileciteturn0file7L1-L10 fileciteturn0file5L68-L97 fileciteturn0file4L3-L8\n\n这些不但不能在“重做漂亮 UI”的过程中牺牲，反而应该成为 WORK-LAB Observer 最明显的产品特色。\n\n真正应该被淘汰的是这种思维：\n\n```text\n项目\n→ 一堆 status\n→ 一堆 KPI card\n→ 一张 token 图\n→ 一张 governance 表\n```\n\nObserver 3.0 应转为：\n\n```text\n                    WORK-LAB Observer 3.0\n             READ-ONLY AI Workflow Control Plane\n\n                              │\n            ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┐\n            │                 │                 │\n       EXECUTION          PROJECT          TRUST\n            │                 │                 │\n      Trace / Span        Git / Repo       Freshness\n      Agent / Model       Delivery         Coverage\n      Tool / Event        Artifact         Evidence\n      Measurement         Context          Governance\n            │                 │                 │\n            └─────────────────┼─────────────────┘\n                              │\n                         PROVENANCE\n                              │\n                     EXISTING TRUTH BOUNDARY\n                              │\n                 GET / LOOPBACK / LAST-GOOD\n```\n\n**最终建议：不要再做一次 `fusion-v4` 式的大型页面拼装，也不要简单 Fork SigNoz/Langfuse/Grafana。**\n\n下一代 Observer 应把 **Execution Projection、Provenance/Freshness、统一 View Model** 放在架构中心，把 **Overview / Executions / Projects / Delivery / Trust** 放在产品中心，把 **quiet、precise、developer-grade** 放在视觉中心；只有这样，页面“数据准、结构对、布局稳、有质感”才会同时成立，而不是继续在一个第一代 Dashboard 上换皮。"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[{"start_ix":736,"end_ix":765,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"fusion-v3.js","id":"file_000000000c5c81fb9d79524df96bae6d","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrieval_turn":0,"retrieval_file_index":2,"cited_message_idx":40,"cited_message_id":"a074e5e9-28e0-4e1a-92a1-7db4585b5093","search_result_idx":null,"line_range":[59,98],"cloud_doc_url":null,"library_file_id":"libfile_25a13e1ad5fc8191aa5cf8eda3996aeb","authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null,"set_id":null,"spl_version":null,"run_id":null,"title":null,"effective_time":null}}},{"start_ix":766,"end_ix":794,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"api.js","id":"file_00000000dc3481fbb61cffc95084aecc","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrieval_turn":0,"retrieval_file_index":7,"cited_message_idx":45,"cited_message_id":"2fca8e18-8a9a-488c-8685-fb7dd3e770bb","search_result_idx":null,"line_range":[1,10],"cloud_doc_url":null,"library_file_id":"libfile_6c63700e952c8191a15f2f25a07396a6","authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null,"set_id":null,"spl_version":null,"run_id":null,"title":null,"effective_time":null}}},{"start_ix":795,"end_ix":824,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"state.js","id":"file_0000000045e881fba6f0c698e615af40","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrieval_turn":0,"retrieval_file_index":5,"cited_message_idx":43,"cited_message_id":"96300eb0-637d-4aa5-99ce-e3c320a43bb6","search_result_idx":null,"line_range":[68,97],"cloud_doc_url":null,"library_file_id":"libfile_3f94c7a166d481919c5d6763e854e87b","authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null,"set_id":null,"spl_version":null,"run_id":null,"title":null,"effective_time":null}}},{"start_ix":3538,"end_ix":3566,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"api.js","id":"file_00000000dc3481fbb61cffc95084aecc","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrie